---
// ComparisonSection.astro
---

<section class="section-wrapper comparison-section" id="comparison">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header-center">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Finder vs Maggo</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        A better alternative to Finder.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Finder is fine. But you might want something more focused on getting things done quickly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table Container -->
    <div class="table-card">
      <table class="comparison-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="col-feature">Everyday Workflow</th>
            <th class="col-finder">
              <div class="app-header-finder">
                <span class="app-dot finder-dot"></span>
                <span>macOS Finder</span>
              </div>
            </th>
            <th class="col-maggo">
              <div class="app-header-maggo">
                <img src="/images/maggo-logo.png" alt="Maggo Logo" width="20" height="20" style="border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block;" />
                <span>Maggo</span>
                <span class="recommend-badge">Productivity Focus</span>
              </div>
            </th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="feature-label">
              <strong>Core Philosophy</strong>
              <span>General-purpose Mac system browser</span>
            </td>
            <td class="finder-val">Familiar Mac file browsing</td>
            <td class="maggo-val highlight">Familiar file browsing with a productivity focus</td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-label">
              <strong>Window Management</strong>
              <span>Working across folders</span>
            </td>
            <td class="finder-val">Multiple scattered windows</td>
            <td class="maggo-val highlight">Clean tabs in one single window (⌘T)</td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-label">
              <strong>Path Navigation</strong>
              <span>Understanding folder depth</span>
            </td>
            <td class="finder-val">Standard path bar</td>
            <td class="maggo-val highlight">Clear clickable breadcrumbs + navigation</td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-label">
              <strong>File Organization</strong>
              <span>Moving files to their destination</span>
            </td>
            <td class="finder-val">Basic drag &amp; drop operations</td>
            <td class="maggo-val highlight">Faster Move To (⌘⇧M) &amp; Copy To workflows</td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-label">
              <strong>Side-by-side Work</strong>
              <span>Transferring between 2 directories</span>
            </td>
            <td class="finder-val">Standard single-pane browsing</td>
            <td class="maggo-val highlight">Dual split-pane workflows (⌘⇧S)</td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-label">
              <strong>Native Mac Experience</strong>
              <span>Integration with macOS</span>
            </td>
            <td class="finder-val">Native Mac experience</td>
            <td class="maggo-val highlight">Native Mac experience (Swift 6 &amp; SwiftUI)</td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td class="feature-label">
              <strong>Pricing &amp; Model</strong>
              <span>Cost to own</span>
            </td>
            <td class="finder-val">Free with macOS</td>
            <td class="maggo-val highlight price-tag">$19.99 once (Lifetime support, no subscription)</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- Respectful concluding stance -->
    <div class="stance-block">
      <div class="stance-badge">The Bottom Line</div>
      <p class="stance-text">
        The point isn't: <em>Finder is bad.</em>
      </p>
      <p class="stance-quote">
        It's: <strong>Maggo is for people who want more efficient everyday file management.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .comparison-section {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .section-header-center {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
  }

  .table-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow-x: auto;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .comparison-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
    min-width: 640px;
  }

  .comparison-table th {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: #F8FAFC;
  }

  .col-feature {
    width: 32%;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .col-finder {
    width: 34%;
  }

  .col-maggo {
    width: 34%;
    background: #F0F7FF !important;
  }

  .app-header-finder, .app-header-maggo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .app-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .finder-dot { background-color: #64748B; }
  .maggo-dot { background-color: var(--color-accent); }

  .recommend-badge {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: #8854D0;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .comparison-table td {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .feature-label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .feature-label strong {
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .feature-label span {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .finder-val {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .maggo-val {
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .maggo-val.highlight {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  .price-tag {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .stance-block {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
  }

  .stance-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    background: #E2E8F0;
    color: #475569;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .stance-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stance-quote {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }
</style>
